---
/**
 * Floating basket button — appears only once something is in the cart, and
 * takes the customer to /checkout/.
 *
 * Deliberately NOT a nav item. `Nav.astro` is v1's markup ported pixel-for-pixel
 * (PRD §8), and threading a badge through it risks the desktop nav wrapping —
 * the same reason the "Order Now" copy was left alone in Phase 4. A FAB is
 * additive, follows the pattern `WhatsAppFab.astro` already established, and is
 * where a thumb already is on the phone, which is where the orders come from.
 *
 * It sits above the WhatsApp FAB rather than beside it, so neither covers the
 * other, and it starts hidden: an empty cart shows nothing at all.
 */
---

<a
  href="/checkout/"
  class="cart-fab js-cart-hide-empty"
  id="cartFab"
  hidden
  aria-label="Review your order"
>
  <svg
    width="26"
    height="26"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="2"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"></circle>
    <circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"></circle>
    <path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"></path>
  </svg>
  <span class="cart-fab-count js-cart-count">0</span>
</a>
